00:17:28.355 --> 00:17:30.591
- This isn't about any one person.

00:17:30.591 --> 00:17:32.660
It's about this company.

00:17:32.660 --> 00:17:35.827
It's about a company that's important,

00:17:36.861 --> 00:17:41.028
it's forward-thinking, it's
innovative, it's ethical,

00:17:42.169 --> 00:17:46.892
that hires great people and
lets 'em lead great lives.

00:17:46.892 --> 00:17:50.277
It helps people around the world

00:17:50.277 --> 00:17:52.694
realize their full potential.

00:17:56.024 --> 00:18:00.204
(softly exhales) It's my
whole professional world.

00:18:00.204 --> 00:18:03.777
Microsoft's like a fourth child to me.

00:18:03.777 --> 00:18:06.661
Children do leave the house.

00:18:06.661 --> 00:18:08.981
In this case, I guess
I'm leaving the house.

00:18:08.981 --> 00:18:11.217
