00:18:36.967 --> 00:18:39.997
A song that let me say thank you,

00:18:39.997 --> 00:18:43.330
a song that looked back retrospectively,

00:18:45.493 --> 00:18:49.255
and a song that celebrated the future.

00:18:49.255 --> 00:18:51.491
It's from one of my favorite movies,

00:18:51.491 --> 00:18:53.602
it's one of my favorite songs,

00:18:53.602 --> 00:18:56.360
