how he likes to do things.

00:19:07.938 --> 00:19:08.771
Well,

00:19:09.798 --> 00:19:12.034
I want to end with this song.

00:19:12.034 --> 00:19:13.534
Respectful, a song

00:19:15.438 --> 00:19:17.695
that talks about what you've meant to me

00:19:17.695 --> 00:19:20.537
